    "content": "<p>Buckle up, Pilots. From now until<strong> July 1 (until maintenance)</strong>, you can earn<strong> 50% more Pilot XP from Matchmaking Battles!&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pilots must be assigned to a War Robot to earn Pilot XP. Battling levels up the equipped Pilot and unlocks new skills.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Take advantage of this opportunity to improve your Pilot Ranks and try out new Talents!</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Download War Robots: Frontiers for free today:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;5</strong><strong> </strong></a><strong>│</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;4</strong></a> <strong>│ </strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox Series X|S</strong></a><strong> │</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox One</strong></a>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/steam\"><strong>Steam</strong></a><strong> │ </strong><a href=\"https://my.games/play/war_robots_frontiers_mg\"><strong>MY.GAMES Launcher</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stay tuned to our official <a href=\"https://x.com/WRFrontiers\">X</a>, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wrfrontiers\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wrfrontiers/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@wrfrontiers\">TikTok</a> channels, and join the <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/warrobotsfrontiers/\">War Robots: Frontiers subreddit</a> and <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/discord\">Discord</a> for all the latest news and updates.</p>",
